This is F76-checksum-byte-after-nul.tar from the tar-minefield suite
(https://github.com/haampie/tar-minefield, https://stoppels.ch/tar/F76.html).

It is a ustar archive with three 2-byte files: a, b, c.  The checksum
field of the second header ("b") is "007341\0x": the correct sum, a NUL,
and then an 'x' instead of the usual space.  libarchive rejects that
header with ARCHIVE_RETRY and skips ahead to "c".

